      "writtenOn": "2026-11-17T18:00:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The per-batch master check was removed. If the lease is lost mid-cycle (long GC pause, network split, heartbeat delayed behind other watchdog tasks), MasterElection only logs a warning while this instance keeps draining the queue and another instance takes over - two masters again. Suggest restoring a cheap check per batch:\n\n  if (!crossInstanceCoordinationEnabled \u0026\u0026 !masterElection.isMaster(MODULE_SYNC_MASTER_LEASE_NAME)) {\n      log.warn(\"Lost the module-sync master lease mid-cycle; stopping module sync for this cycle\");\n      return;\n  }",
      "revId": "d3e8f8ef9a0bee44ed62e81995b9b7ef0ce9970a",
